Surround yourself with a Tempest, increasing all your lightning damage by [2%, 5%, 6%, 8%, 10% (TL1-5)] and ignoring [14%, 29%, 37%, 42%, 46% (TL1-5)] lightning resistance of your targets.

Your Lightning and Chain Lightning spells also gain a [9%, 18%, 27%, 36%, 45% (TL1-5)] chance to daze, and your Thunderstorm spell gains a [4%, 9%, 13%, 18%, 22% (TL1-5)] chance to daze.
